+/*
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-or-later
+ * Adapted from Fabric Carpet's FertilizableCoral and FeatureGenerator.
+ * Source: gnembon/fabric-carpet, revision f358000b175ddbcf1dd0bc59641c715fb0545664.
